  "reading": {
    "en": "Rullst as `cargo rullst new` generates it (13.0.0-alpha.6, with its production middleware) is in positions 4\u20135 of 14 in the overall score, at 0.75\u00d7 Axum (Axum = 1.00); in the same group as Loco (0.77\u00d7); the closest scores outside its group are Gin (0.83\u00d7, higher) and Fastify (0.61\u00d7, lower). By category: Hello world positions 3\u20136 of 14 (0.50\u00d7); Database positions 3\u20137 of 14 (0.79\u00d7); Application positions 4\u20135 of 14 (0.81\u00d7); Memory (high-water mark) positions 1\u20135 of 14 (1.00\u00d7); Startup positions 1\u201311 of 14 (1.00\u00d7). Memory: its RAM high-water mark under the Tier 3 load was 12 MiB (Axum: 17 MiB on the same runners), both counted as the 64 MiB floor of the Memory score; after the 125 logins of the application endpoints its peak was 470 MiB (Axum: 927 MiB), which no score includes. Its Application figure, and through it the overall score, is affected by this run's PUT /world/{id} problem (\u2021): most of its measured PUT requests did not write, so its PUT ratio and its Application score are higher than they would be with a write. This benchmark is maintained by Rullst's maintainer, who also wrote every implementation in it and designed the method.",
    "pt_br": "O Rullst como o `cargo rullst new` o gera (13.0.0-alpha.6, com o middleware de produ\u00e7\u00e3o dele) est\u00e1 nas posi\u00e7\u00f5es 4\u20135 de 14 na pontua\u00e7\u00e3o geral, com 0,75\u00d7 o Axum (Axum = 1,00); no mesmo grupo que Loco (0,77\u00d7); as pontua\u00e7\u00f5es mais pr\u00f3ximas fora do grupo s\u00e3o Gin (0,83\u00d7, acima) e Fastify (0,61\u00d7, abaixo). Por categoria: Hello world: posi\u00e7\u00f5es 3\u20136 de 14 (0,50\u00d7); Banco de dados: posi\u00e7\u00f5es 3\u20137 de 14 (0,79\u00d7); Aplica\u00e7\u00e3o: posi\u00e7\u00f5es 4\u20135 de 14 (0,81\u00d7); Mem\u00f3ria (pico): posi\u00e7\u00f5es 1\u20135 de 14 (1,00\u00d7); Inicializa\u00e7\u00e3o: posi\u00e7\u00f5es 1\u201311 de 14 (1,00\u00d7). Mem\u00f3ria: o pico de RAM dele sob a carga do Tier 3 foi de 12 MiB (Axum: 17 MiB nas mesmas m\u00e1quinas), ambos contados como o piso de 64 MiB da pontua\u00e7\u00e3o de Mem\u00f3ria; depois dos 125 logins dos endpoints de aplica\u00e7\u00e3o, o pico dele foi de 470 MiB (Axum: 927 MiB), que nenhuma pontua\u00e7\u00e3o inclui. O n\u00famero de Aplica\u00e7\u00e3o dele, e por meio dele a pontua\u00e7\u00e3o geral, \u00e9 afetado pelo problema do PUT /world/{id} desta rodada (\u2021): a maioria das requisi\u00e7\u00f5es PUT medidas dele n\u00e3o gravou, ent\u00e3o a raz\u00e3o do PUT e a pontua\u00e7\u00e3o de Aplica\u00e7\u00e3o dele s\u00e3o mais altas do que seriam com uma grava\u00e7\u00e3o. Este benchmark \u00e9 mantido pelo mantenedor do Rullst, que tamb\u00e9m escreveu todas as implementa\u00e7\u00f5es dele e projetou o m\u00e9todo."
  },
